<div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-text-muted" data-booking-policy="{{ config('resort.policy.confirmed_version') }}">
    <p class="font-semibold">Booking policy {{ config('resort.policy.confirmed_version') }} · Published {{ config('resort.policy.published_on') }} · Future bookings only; existing bookings retain their saved prices and accepted policy.</p>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li><strong>Rooms:</strong> Standard overnight stay is 2 PM to noon the next day. Online early requests are limited to two hours at <x-amount :value="200" /> per room hour, subject to availability; earlier requests go to staff. Less than 20 minutes early is free; 20–60 minutes is one hour, then each further started hour. Staff-approved late checkout is <x-amount :value="300" /> per room hour after a fresh conflict check.</li>
        <li><strong>Same-day rooms:</strong> Choose check in and check out on the same date, including 9 AM–5 PM. One full room base rate applies, with no automatic early or late fee. Availability is checked before submission and approval. A departed room remains unavailable until staff mark cleaning complete, including after automatic checkout. Other services retain their own schedules and pricing.</li>
        <li><strong>Payment:</strong> At least 50% down payment reserves a booking; you may pay 100% online. Proof stays under review until verified. The verified amount and remaining balance are shown separately; remaining balance is due at physical check-in.</li>
        <li><strong>Cancellation and refunds:</strong> Before physical check-in, including no-show, request cancellation and a full refund of verified payments. Staff receive the request and notify the owner. The owner approves refunds; administrators record that approval and the funds returned. A refund request, owner approval, and money returned are separate stages. Completed physical check-in ends this eligibility.</li>
        <li><strong>Rescheduling:</strong> No notice deadline before physical check-in. Staff check the new service, date, availability, and price difference before confirmation. Original booking and payment history remain auditable.</li>
        <li><strong>Children:</strong> Under one year are free for rooms and packages and excluded from maximum capacity. Declare older children within the guest count; the owner decides their charge. Pay the base deposit first. Any later owner-approved charge is recorded and the revised total shown. A dispute holds the booking for staff discussion, not automatic charging or cancellation.</li>
        <li><strong>Pets:</strong> <x-amount :value="500" /> once per booking, including multi-service bookings. Diapers and a cage or leash are required; pets cannot enter swimming pools.</li>
        <li><strong>Adjustments:</strong> Staff record check in discounts with a reason. Overpayments remain visible for the owner to decide whether to refund or apply to a guest-agreed charge.</li>
        <li><strong>Multiple services:</strong> One booking and one deposit calculation. Alternatives are suggestions only; replacements require a fresh availability check, revised quote, and guest acceptance. Cancelling one item in a group requires recorded staff discussion and an owner-directed refund decision.</li>
    </ul>
</div>
